uch gifts will be bound by this requirement","unit_id":"u14"},{"quote":"as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","unit_id":"u13"}],"distinction":"Retains the parent’s general-product interpretation. A defined distributor’s non-discount gift promoting a product outside SFC-authorised funds can be caught. The supplied non-gift snapshot does not refute this reading. Its strongest uncertainty is whether u14’s general wording can extend beyond the circular’s fund-specific subject.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds within the distributor description in u1.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u29"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit is offered to a client; actual acceptance or delivery is unnecessary for this offer fact.","name":"benefit_offered_to_client","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit qualifies as a gift, assessed before applying the express discount exception; an additional return or incentive is not automatically classified as a gift.","name":"benefit_is_gift","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit itself qualifies as a discount of fees or charges within u14's exception; merely including a discount elsewhere in a package is insufficient to establish this fact.","name":"benefit_is_fee_discount","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The offer is made in promoting a specific investment product or particular investment-product type to the client, including promotional linkage to a type such as funds from certain fund houses.","name":"has_product_promotion_connection","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The product or product type to which this benefit's promotion is connected falls within the circular's SFC-authorised-fund subject matter.","name":"promotion_concerns_authorised_funds","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u15"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"}],"result":"(and benefit_is_gift (not benefit_is_fee_discount))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor benefit_offered_to_client has_product_promotion_connection)"},"local_id":"repair_general_product","questions":["Does the missing paragraph 3.11 support applying this restatement to the defined distributor’s promotion of other investment products?"],"statement":"Selected control: general-product gift-offer restriction. Within scope, an identified offer is caught by the 'should not offer' restriction when the benefit is a gift other than a qualifying fee-or-charge discount. Promotional linkage to a product type suffices without demonstrated distraction. Structured-product classification and section 103 authorisation are separate issues.","subject":"Whether an identified offer is caught by the selected paragraph-10 gift restriction"},{"assumptions":["Evaluation concerns one identified benefit offer to one client.","The distributor definition in u1 governs actor scope.","The fund-specific framing in u1, u13 and u15 limits this circular’s application of u14.","Gift classification precedes the discount exception; neither additional returns nor incentives are automatically gifts.","Unknown facts remain unknown. An out-of-scope offer is not thereby lawful under the Code or other controls."],"citations":[{"quote":"practices in offering and promoting SFC-authorised funds.","unit_id":"u1"},{"quote":"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)","unit_id":"u1"},{"quote":"in offering such returns or other incentives in promoting SFC-authorised funds","unit_id":"u13"},{"quote":"when offering or promoting funds, distributors should not offer additional returns","unit_id":"u15"},{"quote":"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.","unit_id":"u14"}],"distinction":"Adds only the fund-subject scope condition, preserving identical fact meanings and gift outcome. A hypothetical known distributor offering a known non-discount gift with product linkage outside SFC-authorised funds separates the readings: the broader reading catches it; this reading places it outside the selected control. This is a proposed discriminating case, not supplied evidence. The strongest uncertainty is u14’s express general investment-product wording.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor is an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds within the distributor description in u1.","name":"is_distributor","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u29"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit is offered to a client; actual acceptance or delivery is unnecessary for this offer fact.","name":"benefit_offered_to_client","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit qualifies as a gift, assessed before applying the express discount exception; an additional return or incentive is not automatically classified as a gift.","name":"benefit_is_gift","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u13","u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The identified benefit itself qualifies as a discount of fees or charges within u14's exception; merely including a discount elsewhere in a package is insufficient to establish this fact.","name":"benefit_is_fee_discount","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The offer is made in promoting a specific investment product or particular investment-product type to the client, including promotional linkage to a type such as funds from certain fund houses.","name":"has_product_promotion_connection","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u14"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"},{"meaning":"The product or product type to which this benefit's promotion is connected falls within the circular's SFC-authorised-fund subject matter.","name":"promotion_concerns_authorised_funds","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u15"],"type":"bool","unit":"truth value"}],"result":"(and benefit_is_gift (not benefit_is_fee_discount))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_distributor benefit_offered_to_client has_product_promotion_connection promotion_concerns_authorised_funds)"},"local_id":"repair_fund_context","questions":["Is the circular merely illustrating a broader Code restriction, or limiting the selected restatement’s application to its fund subject matter?"],"statement":"Selected control: fund-context gift-offer restriction. For a defined distributor offering a benefit to a client in promoting SFC-authorised funds or a relevant fund type, the offer is caught when it is a gift other than a qualifying fee-or-charge discount. The restriction includes fund-house linkage and does not require actual distraction or structured-product status. Other-product offers fall outside this selected contextual control, subject to unresolved external Code requirements.","subject":"Whether an identified offer is caught by the selected paragraph-10 gift restriction"}]}},"run_id":"run.d6106e5450c749a58852e36e6f81a6e0"}